WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.445 --> 00:00:02.725
[Painful scream]

00:00:04.756 --> 00:00:06.037
[Painful scream]

00:00:07.195 --> 00:00:08.437
KATE BISHOP
Who the hell was that?

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.530
FLORENCE PUGH
When there were early discussions of

00:00:12.597 --> 00:00:13.811
if Yelena was gonna come back

00:00:13.862 --> 00:00:18.353
I did not see it coming, that they were
gonna put me and Clint against each other,

00:00:18.411 --> 00:00:19.853
which I thought was a really cool twist.

00:00:20.084 --> 00:00:22.978
CLINT BARTON
Someone has hired a Black Widow assassin.

00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:24.986
This has gotten very real, very quickly.

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:29.244
HAILEE STEINFELD
Yelena is such an amazing character,

00:00:29.268 --> 00:00:31.997
and her and Kate have quite
a lot of fun together.

00:00:32.048 --> 00:00:33.048
YELENA BELOVA
Kate Bishop.

00:00:33.409 --> 00:00:34.409
[Groan]

00:00:35.106 --> 00:00:37.501
YELENA BELOVA
Hi! I made macaroni, if you want some.

00:00:37.551 --> 00:00:39.231
It's really tasty. Really tasty.

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:40.638
KATE BISHOP
I know what boxed mac and cheese

00:00:40.689 --> 00:00:42.724
tastes like, okay? I know it's –
I know it's delicious.

00:00:42.775 --> 00:00:44.075
RHYS THOMAS
Bringing someone like Florence,

00:00:44.123 --> 00:00:46.497
it really brings in an interesting
dynamic with Kate.

00:00:46.548 --> 00:00:48.802
Like, I think that's what was
really fun, was actually to see

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.455
how these two characters click.

00:00:50.506 --> 00:00:53.103
BERTIE
To see Natasha Romanov's sister sitting,

00:00:53.154 --> 00:00:55.911
talking to Clint Barton's protégé,

00:00:55.962 --> 00:00:57.880
we just sat back and really enjoyed it.

00:00:57.935 --> 00:01:00.086
YELENA BELOVA
I love American Christmases - the tree,

00:01:00.157 --> 00:01:03.602
the super-powered reindeer!
Have you ever eaten reindeer?

00:01:03.653 --> 00:01:04.704
KATE BISHOP
I cannot say I've had the pleasure.

00:01:04.755 --> 00:01:06.118
YELENA BELOVA
No, it is not a pleasure.

00:01:06.173 --> 00:01:07.860
It's really tough. It's chewy.

00:01:07.911 --> 00:01:09.493
FLORENCE PUGH
When we finished Black Widow,

00:01:09.544 --> 00:01:14.285
my whole experience was with Scarlett,
and she really welcomed me into the MCU.

00:01:14.336 --> 00:01:19.546
And then to jump into her scene
partner's world was just as sweet.

00:01:19.597 --> 00:01:22.054
It's been a really good
first two years in the MCU.

